config LED_PLAYER
	bool "Enable the LED player"
	depends on LED
	help
	  LED player allow to play an animation
	  on a LED.
	   This is useful when the LED is the only way
	   to get a status. using the LED player, we could
	   create an play a specific animation for each
	   status to report using the LED.
